          "proof": "ai-generated"
        },
        "physical_scope": "A dimensionless coarse-grained order-parameter example illustrating a possible failure of a singleton variational-minimizer assumption; it is not a continuum Gibbs-potential calculation.",
        "dependency_level": 7,
        "generation": {
